line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4259671/001-7fc9965bca.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4259671/001-7fc9965bca.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"638\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">其实里面</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">包含了三个信息！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">“寻找相同的想法”</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">“珍惜相遇”</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">“比喻与给予的力量”</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">指挥的时候</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">没法讲得太详细</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">所以现在想</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">再详细解释一点！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">信息 1</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">“寻找相同的想法”</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">X・Y的标题中</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">包含了X轴与Y轴相交的交叉点</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">不是去寻找差异</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">而是去寻找相同之处</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">这样的主题！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">比如说\n\n不同国家的文化和语言\n\n社会 宗教 思想\n\n穿着打扮和容貌也各不相同\n\n但还是要试着寻找相同之处！\n\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">眼睛有两只，手指有五根，还有鼻子和嘴巴</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">会玩耍、睡觉、聊天</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">会思考，也会感动</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">都有喜怒哀乐</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">再比如</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">思考方式和表达方式的差异</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">绘画 料理 摄影 音乐</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">看起来全都不一样</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">但寻找相同之处的话……</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">都有材料</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">都需要工具</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">都是创造出来的</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">都是需要做出判断的</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">都需要品位和感性</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">而想得到意见</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">也都需要有能看、能听、能品尝的对方</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">很多事情</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">看起来各不相同</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">但只要寻找交叉点</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">就会发现它们之间</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">其实有着非常接近的关系</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">信息 2</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">“珍惜相遇”\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">我们</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">只能与生活在同一时代的人相遇</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">增田无法见到巴赫</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">也无法见到贝多芬</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">祖父和祖母在同一时代相遇</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">生下了父亲和母亲</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">父亲和母亲也与同一时代的人相遇</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">然后</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">才有了我们</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">我们能够相遇的人</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">能够爱上的人</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">只有那些与我们的人生一百年重叠的人</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">在地球上</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">我们只能与</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">仅仅这些人相遇</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">这样想想……</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">能够拥有如此奇迹般相遇的</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">同一时代的人，都是珍贵的存在</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">贬低对方</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">互相憎恨</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">彼此厮杀</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">挑起争端</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">原来都是在破坏这场奇迹般相遇的行为</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">为什么</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">人要活着？</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">其中一个理由</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">或许就是</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">“为了与人相遇”</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">不是吗？</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">信息 3</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">“比喻与给予的力量”</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">只有人类拥有的能力</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">比喻</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">“让人与宇宙融为一体”</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">视野的解放</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">“为盛开的花添上温柔\n<br>\n互相赠予，心便相连”\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">不是去夺取</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">而是由自己去赠予、去给予</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">这里面</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">融入了比喻与给予的力量</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">从这三个信息出发</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">寻找共同点</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">接受差异</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">让我们共同建设一个</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">没有争斗</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">没有恐怖袭击</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">没有歧视的</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">美好的世界</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">闪耀的世界</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">让我们一起来创造吧！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">这就是</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">那首片尾曲</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">“KISEKI”</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">所寄托的</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">信息</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">下回再见！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">（附赠内容）</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">KISEKI是\n\n增田亲自向\n\n各语言的本地化负责人\n\n讲述上述内容后\n\n再由他们在各语言中\n\n意译而成的\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">另外</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">因为希望全世界的人都能歌唱</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">也希望大家能上传到</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">社交平台</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">所以标题</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">定为</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">#KISEKI</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">了</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">发售后……</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">世界各地的人们都唱了</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">还上传了出来！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">谢谢大家！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">增田真的非常开心！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">“KISEKI”</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">作曲 景山将太</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">作词 增田顺一 松岛贤司</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">在这颗星球的同一时代\n<br>\n与活着的人相遇\n<br>\n在宇宙的时间长河中\n<br>\n仅仅一百年 奇迹般的相遇\n<br>\n包容对方 彼此感谢\n<br>\n共同创造下一个时代\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n小小的花蕾 不要互相争夺\n<br>\n共同守护 一起培育\n<br>\n为盛开的花添上温柔\n<br>\n互相赠予 心便相连\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n人与宇宙能够融为一体\n<br>\n寻找轴线交汇的那个点\n<br>\n梦想满溢的世界便会诞生\n<br>\n独一无二的 闪耀世界\n<br>\n创造充满感谢的未来\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n重叠的这百年\n<br>\n相遇孕育奇迹\n<br>\n\n\n<br></div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ポケットモンスター X・Yの</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">エンディング</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">KISEKI</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ワシントン D.C   WCS 2014</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ボストン  WCS 2015</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ロサンゼルス  E3 2016</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">と</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">オーケストラの指揮を</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">させて頂きましたが</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">毎回</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">指揮の前に</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">この曲の意味を伝えています！</div>\n<div class=\"