>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">私たちが産まれました</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">私たちが出会える人</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">愛せる人は</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">人生100年に重なった人だけなのです</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">地球上にいる</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">たったそれだけの人しか</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">出会うことは出来ません</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">そう考えると・・</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">そんな奇跡的な出会いをしている</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">同じ時代の人は大切な存在</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">相手をけなし</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">いがみ合い</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">殺し合い</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">争いを起こすことは</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">奇跡の出会いを壊す行為だと分かります</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">なぜ</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">人は生きているのか？</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">その理由の１つに</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">「人と出会うため」</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">というのが</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">あるのではないでしょうか？</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">メッセージ  3</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">「比喩と贈与のチカラ」</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">人間だけが持っている能力</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">比喩</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">「人と宇宙がひとつになれる」</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">視野の解放</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">「咲いた花に優しさ添えて\n<br>\n  贈り合えば心つながる」\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">奪うのではなく</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">自らが贈ること与えること</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ここには</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">比喩と贈与のパワーを</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">埋め込んでいます</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">3つのメッセージから</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">共通点を探し</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">違いを受け入れ</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">争いのない</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">テロのない</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">差別のない</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">素晴らしい世界を</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">輝く世界を</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">私たちで築いて行こう！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">それが</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">あのエンディング</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">「KISEKI」</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">に込められた</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">メッセージなのです</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">チャオ！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">（オマケ）</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">KISEKIは\n\n直接マスダから\n\n各言語のローカライズ担当者に\n\n上記をお話しして\n\n各言語で意訳しています\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">また</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">世界中の方に歌って欲しくて</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">SNSに</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">アップしてもらえるように</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">タイトルは</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">#KISEKI</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">としました</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">発売後・・</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">世界中の方が歌って</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">アップしてくださいました！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ありがとう！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">マスダ とてもハッピーです！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">「KISEKI」</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">作曲 景山将太</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">作詞 増田順一 松島賢司</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">この星の　同じ時代に\n<br>\n生きる人と　出会うこと\n<br>\n宇宙の　時の中では\n<br>\nたった100年　奇跡の出会い\n<br>\n相手を包み　感謝しよう\n<br>\nともに次代を　作っていこう\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n小さなつぼみ　奪い合わずに\n<br>\nともに守り　育んでいこう\n<br>\n咲いた花に　優しさ添えて\n<br>\n贈り合えば　心つながる\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n人と宇宙が　ひとつになれる\n<br>\n軸が交わる　ポイント探せば\n<br>\n夢があふれる　世界生まれる\n<br>\nたったひとつの　輝く世界\n<br>\n感謝あふれる　未来作ろう\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n重なる100年の\n<br>\n出会いが奇跡を生む\n<br>\n\n\n<br></div>"}}